<h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>
<h3>What is an AI agent?</h3>
<p>An AI system that pursues goals on its own, using tools and apps to take actions instead of only answering questions.</p>
<h3>What is agentic AI?</h3>
<p>AI built to act autonomously: plan, decide and execute multi-step tasks with limited supervision.</p>
<h3>Is Grok Bot the same as Grok?</h3>
<p>No. Grok is the chatbot. Grok Bot is a separate agent product with its own cloud computer.</p>
<h3>Are OpenAI Dots free?</h3>
<p>Not standalone. Your first dot is included with ChatGPT Pro or Business Premium.</p>
<h3>Are personal AI agents safe?</h3>
<p>They can be, with tight permissions and low-stakes starting tasks. Treat each one like a new employee with access to your accounts.</p>
